        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Read Input"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770728848677"
          },
          "code": "PARSEINPUT",
          "id": "1770726220716",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770726220716_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "-Parse user input \"\" {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} \"\" for user intent and set variable values as per below rules:\n1) \"itemNumber\" with item number in user input.\n2) \"itemDescription\" with item description in user input.\n3) \"supplierName\" with supplier or vendor name in user input. For supplierName prefer proper nouns and common vendor keywords (Inc, Ltd, Co.).  Understand that user input could sometimes contain site name eg- SupplierName (Site) , exclude site while extrating supplier. \n4) \"referencePO\" with Purchase Order number (PO) in user input.\n5) priceHistoryAnchor: string (YYYY-MM-DD) = {{$context.$system.$currentDate}} minus {{$context.$variables.priceHistoryWindow}} days.\n6) delayedSupplyAnchor: string (YYYY-MM-DD) = {{$context.$system.$currentDate}} plus {{$context.$variables.delayedSupplyWindow}} days.\n7) overdueSupplyAnchor: string (YYYY-MM-DD) = {{$context.$system.$currentDate}} minus {{$context.$variables.overdueSupplyWindow}} days.\n8) Scenario mapping (choose single best scenario) for user intent:\n   - 10 : Get Delayed Orders or supply.\n   - 20 : Get (alternate/approved) supplier for given item.\n   - 30 : Create (alternate) purchase order.\n   - 40 : Get overdue Orders or supply (past due orders already delayed).\n   - 45 : Send email to Supplier about overdue/Delayed orders.\n   - 50 : Suggest 'Category' for ItemDescription.\n   - 60 : Suggest 'Price' for Item.\n   - 0  : Everything else / unknown."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"overdueSupplyAnchor\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"delayedSupplyAnchor\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"referencePO\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"itemNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"itemDescription\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"scenario\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"priceHistoryAnchor\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"supplierName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 5656,
            "y": 5000
          }
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Initialize User Input"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770726607304"
          },
          "code": "INITVARS",
          "id": "1770728848677",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770887361347",
              "name": "supplier",
              "type": "string",
