  "name": "Demo- Debug",
  "description": "Agent Team to help users with:\n1. Identifying purchase orders with delayed supply.\n2. Finding alternate supplier for given item.\n3. Create purchase order.\n4. Identifying past due orders.\n5. Suggest 'Category' based on Item description.\n6. Suggest 'Price' for Item.",
